                        "tree_id":  "e6157f3c5f6001709efd1697f6a348b3e4b003cc",
                        "message":  "ci(dast): authenticated JWT scan (ZAP Automation Framework) + @WithMockEpuUser test support (#61)\n\n* ci(dast): add authenticated JWT scan (ZAP Automation Framework) + reusable @WithMockEpuUser\n\nDAST (Pipeline 4):\n- add .zap/zap-jwt-config.yaml: Automation Framework plan with JWT context\n  (json auth on /auth/login, header session management on data.accessToken,\n  OpenAPI import from /v3/api-docs, spider + active scan with API policy,\n  JSON/HTML/XML reports, exitStatus gate on High)\n- pipeline-4-dast-scan: run the plan when DAST_STAGING_USER/PASS are set,\n  degrade to the unauthenticated baseline scan otherwise, then gate on\n  HIGH/CRITICAL alerts only and always upload the reports\n- keep the fixes already landed on dev (chmod 777 for the ZAP container,\n  relative report path, fail only on HIGH/CRITICAL)\n\nTest support:\n- add @WithMockEpuUser + WithMockEpuUserSecurityContextFactory so security\n  aware tests can bootstrap a JwtUserPrincipal without a real JWT\n- add factory test (3 cases)\n\n* docs(dast): document the DAST staging account, RBAC limitation and login rate limit\n\n* docs(dast): record verified root cause of the 500 responses and staging memory-quota risk",
                        "timestamp":  "2026-10-21T15:13:11Z",
